                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4fa8a2c2-beca-3766-9355-d4d2464e15f4",
                        "entry_id": "47811a77-a339-303a-bd1a-95ab305705c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "innerer Drang, unter allen Umständen seine Existenz zu bewahren"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8645aa8-aa67-4f44-8f3c-68d131c1cf09",
                                "sense_id": "4fa8a2c2-beca-3766-9355-d4d2464e15f4",
                                "text": "„Die Hoffnung ist eine der stärksten Triebfedern des Lebens und in Grenzfällen sogar mit dem Selbsterhaltungstrieb identifizierbar.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "550b7c15-040a-49e2-af4b-cb4ceea86d24",
                        "source_entry_id": "47811a77-a339-303a-bd1a-95ab305705c2",
                        "source_sense_id": "4fa8a2c2-beca-3766-9355-d4d2464e15f4",
                        "source_sense_description": "innerer Drang, unter allen Umständen seine Existenz zu bewahren",
                        "target_lang_word": "survival instinct",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "survival instinct",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ba29d95-75a8-3f46-9542-d81a57107eb6",
                                        "entry_id": "c65d16f2-5f26-3286-b6c3-c0760b89667f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various unlearned, unthinking responses that serve to preserve one's life or make it difficult to risk one's life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d08d873-ae7a-4bca-a0ed-dfa23148b7e6",
                                                "sense_id": "0ba29d95-75a8-3f46-9542-d81a57107eb6",
                                                "text": "The instinct most likely to intrude on the survival instinct is the instinct of sex, which stands in the same relation to the preservation of the race as does the survival instinct to the preservation of the individual."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b156fef2-a58f-4ae6-a043-872554d77f48",
                                                "sense_id": "0ba29d95-75a8-3f46-9542-d81a57107eb6",
                                                "text": "The \"every man for himself\" attitude, for example, is typical of this type of basic instinct. It is usually triggered by a state of panic. Although this selfish survival instinct may seem abhorrent in action, it is nevertheless a natural aspect of human behavior."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4010500-3986-4f91-89ef-a6d4f3c8b742",
                                                "sense_id": "0ba29d95-75a8-3f46-9542-d81a57107eb6",
                                                "text": "The prey drive, or chase instinct, is another survival instinct."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3504bf53-0114-4704-b699-35004f4ba3a8",
                                                "sense_id": "0ba29d95-75a8-3f46-9542-d81a57107eb6",
                                                "text": "You are born with a survival instinct that helps you take care of yourself and your loved ones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b2d960b-01f1-4dc6-9ca8-0004a2ae4393",
                                                "sense_id": "0ba29d95-75a8-3f46-9542-d81a57107eb6",
                                                "text": "This is a primitive survival instinct to guard against predators and potential danger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d6d9c95-94a1-4ea1-a262-7b8aebb597c8",
                                                "sense_id": "0ba29d95-75a8-3f46-9542-d81a57107eb6",
                                                "text": "As with all mammals, the survival instinct is innate in humans. We always strive to preserve our health and our lives, have a great need for security and protection and are constantly on the lookout to avoid danger."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "991eb30f-073e-36f2-9293-e30ae24cb081",
                                        "entry_id": "c65d16f2-5f26-3286-b6c3-c0760b89667f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The will to live and thrive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf407da5-b549-4c46-a381-89b50bae8a93",
                                                "sense_id": "991eb30f-073e-36f2-9293-e30ae24cb081",
                                                "text": "The Cicadas' must be one of the most chillingly vivid of all of Elizabeth's narratives of sexual predatoriness, emotional vulnerability, and the mean-spirited but triumphant survival instinct that forms the jungle of human struggle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b58ff961-4fe0-48df-b7ff-47c83794a2f2",
                                                "sense_id": "991eb30f-073e-36f2-9293-e30ae24cb081",
                                                "text": "The better approach is to show them that their survival instinct is tied to cooperation, not turf."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb9468e8-85bf-4e0c-b435-0b2bc0cc6adf",
                                                "sense_id": "991eb30f-073e-36f2-9293-e30ae24cb081",
                                                "text": "Hunger, deprivation and humiliation were our constant companions, and only hope and our survival instinct kept us going."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "800b952e-5220-40a2-91cc-4b826757f507",
                                                "sense_id": "991eb30f-073e-36f2-9293-e30ae24cb081",
                                                "text": "Bayet seems intent on distinguishing the survival instinct from the political instinct. I submit that in the context of a substantial power imbalance between groups reified by a calculated legal framework, the survival instinct cannot be assumed distinct from the political one."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e4a4d66-93a6-4da9-bb4e-18da4a50c689",
                                                "sense_id": "991eb30f-073e-36f2-9293-e30ae24cb081",
                                                "text": "Trapped between two hostile platoons in the woods, Rubakhin obeys the survival instinct and covers the prisoner's mouth and nose to keep him silent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
